data: {"id": "d2673bc54f1c4543-thinking-parallel_evidence-168", "run_id": "d2673bc54f1c4543", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "收到。我将立即执行证据采集计划，首先并行启动 Kubernetes 核心查询（Get YAML、Describe）以及补证 Prometheus 查询。\n\n### 1. 核心证据采集 (K8s + Prometheus)\n\n```bash\n# 并行执行计划中的 Kubernetes 核心查询\nkubectl get pod workload -n aiops-case-v13 -o yaml > /tmp/k8s_pod_yaml.txt\nkubectl describe pod workload -n aiops-case-v13 > /tmp/k8s_pod_desc.txt\nkubectl logs workload -n aiops-case-v13 --tail=200 > /tmp/pod_logs.txt 2>&1\n```\n\n**执行工具：**\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 1, "ts_ms": 1789368275316, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

