data: {"id": "d2673bc54f1c4543-thinking-parallel_evidence-975", "run_id": "d2673bc54f1c4543", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 根因诊断分析\n\n#### 1. 实体状态确认\n*   **实体身份**：Pod `aiops-case-v13/workload`，UID `55a9fc8d-e1ae-4de7-be20-31e5843788ad`。\n*   **当前状态**：Pod YAML 显示 `phase: Running` 且 `status: Terminating` (在 describe 中)。\n*   **Terminating 证据**：\n    *   `metadata.deletionTimestamp`: `2026-09-14T07:48:49Z` (存在)。\n    *   `metadata.finalizers`: `<none>` (无 finalizer 阻塞)。\n    *   `deletionGracePeriodSeconds`: `3900` (65 分钟)。\n\n#### 2. 候选原因验证：TerminatingStuck\n*   **反驳证据**：\n    *   **无 Finalizer 阻塞**：YAML 明确显示 `finalizers: <non", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1789368291416, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

